    <description>An OpenTelemetry .NET exporter that exports to Azure Monitor</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/blob/Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter_1.8.3/sdk/monitor/Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter/CHANGELOG.md</releaseNotes>
